<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Dome posts A$2.02 million net profit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Dome posts A$2.02 million net profit.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dome Resources NL said on Monday it posted a net profit of A$2.019 million in the year ended June 30, 1996, compared with a loss of A$677,000 in 1994/95.</p>
<p>The turnaround follows commencement of gold and silver production in December from the company's Tolukuma mine 100 km north of Port Moresby in Papua New Guinea, the company said.</p>
<p>In the half year to June 30, the mine produced 28,275 ounces of gold and 43,326 ounces of silver, the company said.</p>
<p>As of September 25, the mine's yield stood at 43,649 ounces of gold and 85,545 ounces of silver, it said.</p>
